<tr><td colspan=2>There is to be an official Guild Meeting Event this Saturday, September 8th, 2001 in the Arena Zone as usual at 3:00 PM EST (no I don't know what time that is in your time zone...go figure it out you freakin' LIVE there 8P)<br>
<br>
If it is at ALL possible for you to be in the Arena Zone at that time, I request that you do so.  If you need a port, or protection, that can certainly be provided.  There will be many issues discussed and also promotions and titles given out.  Also as usual the everpresent Tests of Blood will be undertaken by those that need to.<br>
<br>
So - bring you complaints, comments, and suggestions.  A paper shredder will be provided at the door for your convenience.  This will aid in the chaos of the day, as ULUL will be putting the shredded papers back together for interpretation.  8 )<br>
<br>
See you there...and if you can't make it either at the zone or in guildchat, then you must eat some of ULUL's fudge.<br>
